# Paper-figure showcase folder is tracked even though *.png is normally ignored.
!layout_agent/good_result/*.png
!layout_agent/good_result/**/*.png

# F8 (Step 74) full-trace per-sample data is gitignored due to size (~7 GB
# for 178 samples). Only the top-level INDEX.md + aggregate summaries are
# tracked since those are paper-worthy summaries; per-sample raw renders +
# trace JSON can be regenerated by re-running the step74_*.py harnesses.
# Pattern: ignore everything under full_result/, then re-include the small
# paper-worthy bits via !-rules (these only work because the parent dir
# itself is not excluded -- we exclude /** contents, not the dir).
layout_agent/full_result/**
!layout_agent/full_result/INDEX.md
!layout_agent/full_result/_aggregate/
!layout_agent/full_result/_aggregate/**
